{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","穿云箭雨"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","发射箭雨对范围内敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动的，普通攻击会蓄力较长时间，随后发射箭矢，对敌人造成360% ATK的伤害。每1点攻击速度或急速还会额外使自身普通攻击伤害提高0.1%。\n主动释放时，选择一个地图格，对其发射覆盖其周围2格范围的箭雨，对范围内每个格子上的敌人造成270% + 35% ATK伤害并使其定身，持续2秒。每波箭雨命中相同目标的后续伤害降低80%。优先选择敌人最密集的区域进行释放。 "],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":120,"end":126,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":116,"end":130,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":135,"end":137,"tooltip_key":"keyword:immobilize"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，造成的伤害提升至290% + 35% ATK。 "],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，造成的伤害提升至310% + 35% ATK。 "],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，造成的伤害提升至330% + 35% ATK。 "],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时，造成的伤害提升至350% + 35% ATK。 "],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","雷霆之矢"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","发射“雷霆之矢”，对目标附近敌人造成溅射伤害和控制效果。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，格温妮丝的普通攻击以3次为一个循环。格温妮丝普通攻击循环中的第3次，为箭矢附加雷属性，使目标沉默1秒，对目标周围2格范围内所有敌人造成220% + 30% ATK的雷电溅射伤害，并附带0.5秒的眩晕。 "],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":75,"end":81,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":71,"end":85,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","雷电溅射伤害提高至240% + 30% ATK。 "],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","雷电溅射伤害提高至260% + 30% ATK。 "],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","雷电溅射伤害提高至280% + 30% ATK。 "],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","烈焰之矢"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","发射“烈焰之矢”，对目标造成较高伤害并附加“燃烧”效果。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","格温妮丝普通攻击循环中的第2次，为箭矢附加火属性，对敌人造成的伤害提升至490% ATK，并对目标附加“燃烧”效果，使其每0.25秒受到20% + 2% ATK的伤害 ，持续4秒。 “燃烧”持续期间敌人受愈降低40点，不可叠加。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":71,"end":76,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":68,"end":80,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至510% ATK。 "],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至530% ATK。 "],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至550% ATK。 "],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击速度，附近没有敌人时，进一步提高攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高15点攻击速度，当自身1格范围内连续3秒没有敌人时，额外提高9点攻击速度。 "],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高20点攻击速度，当自身1格范围内连续3秒没有敌人时，额外提高12点攻击速度。 "],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高25点攻击速度，当自身1格范围内连续3秒没有敌人时，额外提高15点攻击速度。 "],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","雷焰双弦"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","同时触发“烈焰之矢”和“雷霆之矢”，对目标造成高额伤害并同时触发两种箭矢的效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","格温妮丝普通攻击伤害提高20%。普通攻击循环中的第1次，为箭矢同时附加雷属性和火属性，并且会对雷电溅射到的其他敌人施加“燃烧”效果。 "],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","格温妮丝普通攻击伤害提高25%。 "],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","为箭矢同时附加雷属性和火属性时，还会对主目标额外附加其10%最大生命值的伤害，额外伤害不超过自身360%攻击力。且由本次箭矢造成的所有伤害无视敌人护甲带来的减伤效果的60%和受到伤害降低效果的4%，在非首领模式下，无视受到伤害降低效果的幅度提升至12%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","格温妮丝普通攻击伤害提高30%。 "],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","附近没有敌人时，自身普通攻击间隔缩短。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在周围1格范围内连续3秒没有敌人时，格温妮丝能够进一步集中精神，使自身的普通攻击攻击间隔缩短40%。 "],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","弧光之击"]]}